{
  "info": {
    "name": "Account Service API",
    "description": "Account-service routes. Authenticated CRM/API flows use Bearer {{authToken}}. Payment routes use the internalAuth pattern: gateway/Bearer JWT for user-originated calls, or x-internal-request:true + forwarded x-tenant-id/x-user-* headers for genuine service-to-service calls (no x-api-key here anymore - the accountsApiKey variable/disabled x-api-key headers below are legacy and no longer accepted, kept disabled for reference only). POST routes that use idempotency() accept optional Idempotency-Key (8–128 chars). Internal reminder eligibility: folder \"Internal — reminder eligibility\" (x-api-key + x-tenant-id, used by subscription-service build) - that folder's own internal auth is separate from payment routes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "authToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "memberId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "coaId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "paymentIntentId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "registrationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "applicationId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "batchDetailId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "tenantId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accountsApiKey", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "idempotencyKey", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
